| Strain component | B row | Node i | DOF j | B[r, 3*i + j] = ∂N_i / ∂x_j |
|------------------|--------|--------|--------|------------------------------|
| εₓₓ              | 0      | i      | u      | b_i = ∂N_i/∂x                |
